<description>&lt;p&gt;An illegal gold mine in southwestern Colombia collapsed, killing 14 miners and injuring 7, while a Colombian military helicopter crashed, leaving 19 injured. President De la Espriella has launched a total offensive against ELN and dissident FARC forces in Arauca. Ecuadorian authorities arrested four FARC dissident leaders on the border, linking the insurgent network to the Colombian crisis. The conflict recorded 225 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxQdXlYMzh3QUw0aF9zelFsdV9qVnhWOGV3MWR2UWZDazBxOUdyU2xuZ3JnUEItWEJ3cGYzNGVpVzBMYVAxN2lFdkk3d3lUaHp5Zkt2Yl9YOWdldnpKUnE2YTd4T05FclBQbFRJMEtoY1lpSlNxWDlFLXJjWkhQVjhSUG8xWS1tczVoYnhadGZUd0pqU0JxTjVTVlFsWGFqbjdOZ0NnZkxITVVQaW8tQUNXaEw3OElqal9BTEE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Euronews.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqgFBVV95cUxNWDJYODJHdEJETVdpMXc5eENPdmN2UFFCOTJjME1uaXkydkxTNGR1SEloM2VpWlZKcDIyYkhGcVU2M3NRdWd5Nk04bkpKZjRGZG1WbHhVZExYbldkVlA1eWNsR3p5dVFQRG1rU2FrcWNYVDdrMkg3eVRTMzl6c19fTlZrU1NxWW1MZ1FzTzJJQzRoTnNFaTJMLW8wTmc1bFl1V3NVbC1YLS1aZw?oc=5&quot;&gt;News of Bahrain&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxNSEVmUzJSWmJtcWF4VW9VenRTNEVTbUR5ay1XbXNXeWtfRGw5c0hPRnYwY0FQYnEwSlNhLVNqdUxMUU53QUl2S1NmN01CRGlNRHFKelF4LW5iMWs3SHVJZ0RMbkJuS3JMbE9zQUIzYnpSZWpSRGViRjVPMEdCR0otODVBaWhodURnc0UwbWVBM0Z3QkwyWHQtSDE5dmZETUVKaVI4Zg?oc=5&quot;&gt;Ratopati&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMihgFBVV95cUxOU2JPSjVkN0R5dmRBQWN1Q0kzSTJlNm4yaVROVk93UjYwWWdSVG9MWU54dHd2MVdubkFSMGhhV2J5ZWFFNUlJTy1vUnNHZnJaMGtJWjFYWnBBRldSZkppWHR2WFBzTWIxQk1uSGZjMnZjX3QwalBqOHdReTMxTWs2dF9ScHVKUQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haberler.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;upi&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://new